zw8F3O4diELhg758u_gRKyKxjjTR1tNOrVmHq5fsBVmmE8Dj_d1zfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6XNOqwQT0NsRVB6uqwabtz1-4eQUUm3qxcxCnIwRucbg&oe=6A01E335"}, {"file_name": "barbarians_1.png", "id": "25763710536645694", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308575_25763710539979027_8740020352861949051_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QU22WSkYkhYQ7kNvwG8NoWm&_nc_oc=AdoUa9OIed40a5mCDgIpPF3PCkBOyrn_GezSDhBnOg4MDgoABvJ8hV4XqQEWEh8HlD4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6TxIfr5dPX8209TGK9XaoUrLng3GFfcxInOzQpFT9_gw&oe=6A01C407"}, {"file_name": "barbarians_6.png", "id": "914702717967498", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_914702721300831_2099597177216149039_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mw1tn1FEreYQ7kNvwFjOgYH&_nc_oc=Ado-s9m2SSPO5huOI1uKah41nsJQAEQZ-8cEBM7AZn_x9fjNtKpAwKhmYdGBXA3qFC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af40xeS1woeZCC8sbUSSZwzDlZqb9ZmhvMHGVhaFiG-_bw&oe=6A01C2E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AG_New_2560x1440 (1).png", "id": "4256285161278539", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_4256285164611872_2027858225920969042_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iTHrB06T5lAQ7kNvwELglvQ&_nc_oc=AdqTIq8AB1XgDlZ7aJNadN60rPQO5_5JBeXvxlN1efnxqHn-nRwfSOonKrD4ry3KSt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5OmLr_X97RRuJpURalyNf4Mo4sCScZB4XbY_owQ6mh-Q&oe=6A01C672"}, "display_name": "Animal Guys", "keywords": ["gorilla", "explore", "pets", "dragon", "viking"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                       \n                                                                                                                                                                                   \n{1211805520763804}\n\n# A new hero enters the wild. \u2694\ufe0f\nStep into the armor of the Knight, a fearless new skin ready to charge into chaos, explore dangerous worlds, and take on every challenge with style.                                                                                                                                                    \n\n{25773951658933972}\n\n#  Enter the age of Savage Evolution\n\n\n\n The world of Animal Guys just got wilder. Transform into **primal new skins** \u2014 **Cavemen and Monkeys** \u2014 and unleash your untamed side as you charge through dangerous landscapes, cause hilarious chaos with friends, and explore like never before.\n\n{2359547311189609}\n\nJourney across the lush **Valley** \ud83c\udf3f, push your survival instincts on the frozen** Ice Mountain** \u2744\ufe0f, and brave the molten dangers of the **Volcano** \ud83c\udf0b. Each world grows more intense as you advance, rewarding bold explorers who dare to go further.\n\nYou won\u2019t face the wild alone. Team up with **loyal Wolves \ud83d\udc3a, powerful Bears \ud83d\udc3b, fierce Tigers \ud83d\udc2f, and legendary Dragons \ud83d\udc09**. Wander together, level up your companions, and create unforgettable moments as you run, clash, and laugh your way through unpredictable encounters.\n\n{1591983862037956}\n\nWhether you\u2019re racing across terrain, stirring up multiplayer mayhem, or forging your own primal legend, **Savage Evolution brings a louder, funnier, and more chaotic energy to every adventure.**\n\nThe wild is calling \u2014 gather your crew, embrace the chaos, and evolve.\n\nAnd don't miss the #wild-talk in our Discord channel >> **https://discord.com/channels/1014620047827804281/1386750138390941776**\n\n", "short_description": "Go primal in the Savage Evolution update \u2014 become a Caveman or Monkey, conquer dangerous worlds, and explore alongside Wolves, Bears, Tigers, and legendary Drago